      "created_at": "2015-07-08T16:33:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, there is a way to see how many cards a character has in their hand, though it doesn't work on the character's turn. On a character's section, you'll see a symbol of three yellow cards with a number on it; this tells you how many cards that character has in their hand.</p>",
